cff-version: 1.2.0
title: raDash
message: >-
  If you refer to this software, please cite it using the metadata
  from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Reeves
    given-names: D. Cale
    website: 'https://www.dcalereeves.com'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/dcaler/radash'
abstract: >-
  A research portfolio observatory. raDash reads a Zotero library,
  project folders and the public bibliographic indexes, fits a map of
  what has been read and written, and scores four opportunity signals
  separately rather than blending them. It writes to nothing it
  observes: every source is mounted read-only and the two artifacts it
  emits are text files in its own output directory.
keywords:
  - research portfolio
  - bibliometrics
  - literature mapping
  - latent semantic analysis
  - Zotero
  - OpenAlex
